        <mxCell id="note" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#FFF8E1;strokeColor=#F9A825;fontColor=#5D4037;fontSize=11;spacing=6;" value="LOCAL-FIRST TOPOLOGY.  One `docker-compose up` starts Postgres + Redis + the app. No AWS account, no LocalStack.&#xa;Same transactional core code as production (see infrastructure.drawio); only the NotificationPublisher adapter differs — in-process @nestjs/event-emitter here vs SNS/SQS in prod (ADR-005)." vertex="1">
